    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186660/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.poster.avif?t=1741724134\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186660/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.webm?t=1741724134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186660/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.mp4?t=1741724134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In the deepest and darkest place on Earth no one can hear your scream.<br><br>Dive into the dark world of Escape L.T.D. , where you play as a prisoner in a military base under the ocean. You cannot remember what brought you to this situation, but you are sure of one thing - you must not tarry, because the clock is ticking. There are no answers - only questions: where did such destruction come from? Why are there no other survivors? And what kind of research has been done here?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186660/extras/89a023f6782793cd2eb28a8dd9aae291.poster.avif?t=1741724134\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186660/extras/89a023f6782793cd2eb28a8dd9aae291.webm?t=1741724134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186660/extras/89a023f6782793cd2eb28a8dd9aae291.mp4?t=1741724134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic linear adventure game<br></li><li>Stylish and detailed visuals<br></li><li>Many different puzzles - both environmental and mini-games<br></li><li>Death is always near - the slightest mistake, and you're dead. Be aware of your surroundings<br></li><li>The base is almost completely absorbed by the ocean. Find out the secret of your past and manage to escape before it's too late.<br></li><li>Water is not your worst enemy. Darkness hides more than you can imagine.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186660/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.poster.avif?t=1741724134\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186660/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.webm?t=1741724134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186660/extras/2dc7e7cbf2147ddf6f1c8d86110efaaa.mp4?t=1741724134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>In the deepest and darkest place on Earth no one can hear your scream.<br><br>Dive into the dark world of Escape L.T.D. , where you play as a prisoner in a military base under the ocean. You cannot remember what brought you to this situation, but you are sure of one thing - you must not tarry, because the clock is ticking. There are no answers - only questions: where did such destruction come from? Why are there no other survivors? And what kind of research has been done here?<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186660/extras/89a023f6782793cd2eb28a8dd9aae291.poster.avif?t=1741724134\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186660/extras/89a023f6782793cd2eb28a8dd9aae291.webm?t=1741724134\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2186660/extras/89a023f6782793cd2eb28a8dd9aae291.mp4?t=1741724134\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Classic linear adventure game<br></li><li>Stylish and detailed visuals<br></li><li>Many different puzzles - both environmental and mini-games<br></li><li>Death is always near - the slightest mistake, and you're dead. Be aware of your surroundings<br></li><li>The base is almost completely absorbed by the ocean. Find out the secret of your past and manage to escape before it's too late.<br></li><li>Water is not your worst enemy. Darkness hides more than you can imagine.</li></ul>",
